# Strings that must never appear in this repository: private names, internal
# hostnames, employer or customer names. One case-insensitive regular expression
# per line (Perl-compatible). A line starting with `!` excludes a git pathspec glob.
# Prefix a pattern with (?-i) to make it case-sensitive. See
# scripts/lint-banned-terms.sh.

# The rule file names its own patterns, so it cannot scan itself.
!.banned-terms
